{"page": 9, "width": 629, "height": 814, "text": "PREFACE\nThe State of Environment Report–West Bengal (2016) provides a complete\noverview of the environmental scenario in West Bengal. It aims to serve as a\nreference document that will help environmental decision making while also\nproviding useful information to researchers, non-governmental organisations and\nall those interested in the current state of our environment. The report covers key\nenvironmental issues that include land use, agriculture, forestry, biodiversity,\nindustrial pollution, waste management, air quality and climate change.\nI compliment the WBPCB for bringing out this report. I am confident that\nthe information presented in this report will facilitate various stakeholders in taking\ninformed decisions which will result in sustainable management of the State’s\nenvironment and natural resources.\nKolkata, May 19, 2017 Arnab Roy", "words": [{"text": "PREFACE", "x0": 274.0595, "x1": 349.46092400000003, "top": 259.8856599999999, "doctop": 6771.88566, "bottom": 275.84565999999995, "upright": true, "height": 15.960000000000036, "width": 75.40142400000002, "direction": "ltr"}, {"text": "The", "x0": 103.0322, "x1": 124.870016, "top": 302.91094, "doctop": 6814.91094, "bottom": 316.95094, "upright": true, "height": 14.04000000000002, "width": 21.837816000000004, "direction": "ltr"}, {"text": "State", "x0": 129.421784, "x1": 157.513016, "top": 302.91094, "doctop": 6814.91094, "bottom": 316.95094, "upright": true, "height": 14.04000000000002, "width": 28.09123199999999, "direction": "ltr"}, {"text": "of", "x0": 161.95808, "x1": 173.656208, "top": 302.91094, "doctop": 6814.91094, "bottom": 316.95094, "upright": true, "height": 14.04000000000002, "width": 11.698127999999997, "direction": "ltr"}, {"text": "Environment", "x0": 178.092848, "x1": 251.20193600000005, "top": 302.91094, "doctop": 6814.91094, "bottom": 316.95094, "upright": true, "height": 14.04000000000002, "width": 73.10908800000004, "directio